== 7.8 Chapter 7 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [The International Monetary Fund was set up mainly to],
  [settle trade disputes],
  [finance long-term projects],
  [help members correct short-term balance-of-payments deficits],
  [set oil quotas]
)

#mcq(2, [The World Bank lends mainly for],
  [long-term development projects],
  [military spending],
  [short-term payments support],
  [consumer credit]
)

#mcq(3, [Both the IMF and the World Bank were established at],
  [Yalta],
  [Geneva],
  [Doha],
  [Bretton Woods]
)

#mcq(4, [The organisation that administers the rules of international trade is the],
  [World Bank],
  [WTO],
  [UNCTAD],
  [IMF]
)

#mcq(5, [A member complaining that another is dumping goods may take the case to the],
  [WTO],
  [World Bank],
  [ECOWAS],
  [IMF]
)

#mcq(6, [UNCTAD's work is chiefly],
  [research and advocacy for developing countries],
  [lending],
  [issuing currency],
  [settling disputes]
)

#mcq(7, [The organisation that sets labour standards is the],
  [IMF],
  [OPEC],
  [ILO],
  [WTO]
)

